{
  "uid": "rondo-api",
  "title": "Rondo — API",
  "tags": ["rondo", "api"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "level",
        "label": "Nível de log",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "debug,info,warn,error,fatal",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisições HTTP por segundo",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisições por segundo por rota",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisições por segundo por classe de status",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"2..\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "2xx"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"4..\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "4xx"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taxa de erro (% das requisições)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"4..\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "4xx"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duração p50 / p95 / p99",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duração p95 por rota",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs da API",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "expr": "{service_name=\"rondo-api\"} | detected_level=~\"$level\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Como usar",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 34 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Métricas em **Mimir**, logs em **Loki** e traces em **Tempo**. Os painéis só mostram dados depois que a API recebe requisições: rode `bun run dev` e use o app (ou chame a API) e espere até ~1 minuto, porque as métricas são exportadas a cada 15 s.\n\n- **Por rota:** o label `http_route` é o template da rota; requisições sem rota aparecem como `unmatched`.\n- **Logs → trace:** abra uma linha de log e clique em **Open trace** (campo `trace_id`).\n- **Auth:** veja o dashboard **Rondo — Auth** para operações, motivos de falha e traces dos fluxos de login e conta.\n- O Loki local guarda 24 h; janelas maiores ficam vazias."
      }
    }
  ]
}
